extends Node
## Builds the game's 5x7 pixel font at runtime (no imported assets needed)
## and offers small text-drawing helpers used by every custom-drawn UI.
##
## Glyphs are monospaced: 5x7 pixels inside a 6x9 cell. Lowercase letters
## reuse the uppercase shapes for a consistent all-caps arcade look.
## The font uses integer-only scaling, so sizes 8/16/24 stay crisp.

